# Default interpreter for terminal functions (single underscore prefix: _).
#
# Terminal functions EMIT shell commands. The default interpreter 'cat'
# DISPLAYS those commands without executing them (safe by default): you see
# exactly what would run, then opt in by piping to a shell yourself.
#
# To enable auto-execution (power users):
#   echo sh > .env/local/ELEBAKE_TERMINAL_INTERPRETER
